# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Grid Master — booking e-mail delivery (OPTIONAL but recommended)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The site already delivers bookings with zero configuration through
# FormSubmit. That free relay needs a ONE-TIME activation click in the
# receiving inbox (see docs/booking-email-setup.md).
#
# Setting up one of the providers below is the permanent fix: bookings are then
# e-mailed from your own mail account, with no activation link and nothing an
# ad-blocker can block. Copy this file to `.env` for local testing and add the
# same variables in your host's dashboard (Vercel → Settings → Environment
# Variables, or Netlify → Site settings → Environment variables).
#
# On Vercel the variables are picked up by `api/booking.js`.
# On Netlify they are picked up by `netlify/functions/booking.mjs`.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Where booking mails should arrive (defaults to contactgridmaster@gmail.com)
MAIL_TO=contactgridmaster@gmail.com

# The "from" address your provider has verified. Keep the display name.
MAIL_FROM=Grid Master Website <onboarding@resend.dev>

# --- Pick ONE provider (options are checked in this order) ------------------

# 1) Resend — https://resend.com (free tier, easiest)
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# 2) Brevo — https://brevo.com (free 300 mails/day)
# BREVO_API_KEY=xkeysib-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# 3) SendGrid — https://sendgrid.com
# SENDGRID_API_KEY=SG.xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# 4) Web3Forms (key only, no sender setup) — https://web3forms.com
# WEB3FORMS_KEY=xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx

# 5) Any webhook that accepts JSON (Zapier, Make, Google Apps Script, ...)
# MAIL_WEBHOOK_URL=https://script.google.com/macros/s/XXXX/exec
